1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:02,760
If your mum called you right now, crying,

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,120
asking for money...

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,800
would you know it was really her?

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,020
Starling Bank says scammers can
clone a voice from as little as

5
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,820
3 seconds of audio.

6
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,040
A birthday video.

7
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,070
A voice note.

8
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,920
A clip you posted online.

9
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,350
Then the phone rings.

10
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,590
And it's your daughter.

11
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,630
Or your dad.

12
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:19,530
Crying.

13
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:20,810
They've had an accident.

14
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:21,990
They've been arrested.

15
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:23,935
They need money. Now.

16
00:00:23,935 --> 00:00:25,775
And it's not just voices.

17
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:30,055
In 2024, a finance worker in Hong
Kong joined a video call with

18
00:00:30,055 --> 00:00:33,535
his company's chief financial
officer and a few colleagues.

19
00:00:33,535 --> 00:00:34,835
He recognised them.

20
00:00:34,835 --> 00:00:36,285
He did what they asked.

21
00:00:36,305 --> 00:00:39,575
And he sent about
twenty-five million dollars.

22
00:00:39,575 --> 00:00:44,785
Hong Kong police later said every single
person he saw on that call... was fake.

23
00:00:44,825 --> 00:00:46,245
All deepfakes.

24
00:00:46,245 --> 00:00:48,615
Agree a safe phrase with your family.

25
00:00:48,615 --> 00:00:49,535
Tonight.

26
00:00:49,535 --> 00:00:52,315
A word or a phrase that only you know.

27
00:00:52,315 --> 00:00:53,875
Say it face to face.

28
00:00:53,875 --> 00:00:54,955
Never text it.

29
00:00:54,955 --> 00:00:56,205
Never post it.

30
00:00:56,205 --> 00:00:59,615
If "Mum" ever calls in a
panic asking for money...

31
00:00:59,615 --> 00:01:01,005
ask for the phrase.

32
00:01:01,005 --> 00:01:01,865
No phrase?

33
00:01:01,865 --> 00:01:02,675
Hang up.

34
00:01:02,675 --> 00:01:05,115
And call her back on the
number you already have.

35
00:01:05,115 --> 00:01:08,485
There's one word in this
video I never said out loud.

36
00:01:08,485 --> 00:01:09,415
Spotted it?

37
00:01:09,415 --> 00:01:10,275
Comment it.

38
00:01:10,275 --> 00:01:13,245
Follow for more AI, explained like this.
